Output docs/gifs/dashboard.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set FontSize 13
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Framerate 30
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "bash /Users/sp/code/tmux-agents/docs/demo/setup.sh 3"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "tmux attach-session -t agents-demo"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Show
